********************************************************************
1.ncycl,nsamp (number of MC trial moves, sample every nsamp moves)
2.natoms
3.tref (temperature in K; T* = tref/epsil, 239.6 K -> T* = 2.0)
4.sigma,epsil (LJ parameters in A and K)
5.deltax (maximum displacement in A; delta* = deltax/sigma; tune for ~50% acceptance)
6.rho (reduced density rho*; if <= 0 the configuration is read from mc-conf.data)
